ASoC: FullIO: turn off protection clocks before the Denali reference STOP

Resolve the clock owner through the card, not global state. Apply the exact codec STOP with exhaustive cleanup and preserve the first error.
Do not enable the PA or protection clocks on the reference route yet.
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wsa884x.c
